<Base title="Contact Sharon Miao, LCSW | Free Consultation" description="Book a free 15-minute consultation with Sharon Miao, LCSW. English and Mandarin therapy in NYC, with telehealth in New York, New Jersey and California." counterpart="/zh/contact/"><section class="page-hero"><p class="kicker">Reach Out</p><h1>Taking the first step is an act of courage.</h1><p>I'm here when you're ready. Book a free 15-minute phone consultation by choosing a date and time in the online calendar.</p></section><section class="contact"><div><h2>Book a Free Consultation</h2><p>The consultation is a chance to ask questions, share what has brought you here, and see whether working together feels right. There is no pressure and no commitment.</p>{settings.schedulingUrl?<a class="button" href={withBase(settings.schedulingUrl)}>Book a Free Consultation</a>:<p class="pending"><strong>Before launch:</strong> Add Sharon’s secure consultation-request link in Site settings.</p>}</div><div class="soft"><h2>Availability</h2><p><strong>In-person location:</strong> New York, NY 10016</p><p>Sessions are available in English and Mandarin.</p><p>Accepting new adult clients in New York, New Jersey, and California via telehealth, with in-person sessions available in New York City.</p><p><strong>Session length:</strong> 50 minutes<br><strong>Frequency:</strong> Weekly or bi-weekly</p></div><p><a href={withBase("/faq/")}>View therapy fees and insurance information</a></p></section></Base>
